Id: ngx008f
Severity: FAIL
Category: services
Check: check_nginx
Fix: Run the workers unprivileged (user nginx or www-data).
References: ngx_core_module
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST AC-6, AC-6(2); ISO 8.2; CE User access control

nginx's workers run as root. They parse every request, so a flaw in
request handling is a root flaw; the master alone needs root, to bind
the ports and read the keys at startup.
